### List products
GET http://localhost:5001/products

### Get one product
GET http://localhost:5001/products/1

### Create an order (expected: 201, total 3000)
POST http://localhost:5002/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:5002/orders

### Invalid quantity (expected: 400)
POST http://localhost:5002/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 0}

### Missing product (expected: 404)
POST http://localhost:5002/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 999, "quantity": 1}

### Stop Products API, then send this (expected: 503)
POST http://localhost:5002/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 1}
